      "updated": 1786152978629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hot aisle widened to 4'-0\" (vs. 3'-0\" minimum)\nto allow rear-door swing plus a service body\ninside a contained aisle. This is why the pitch\nis 15'-0\" and not the classic 14'-0\".",
      "originalText": "Hot aisle widened to 4'-0\" (vs. 3'-0\" minimum) to allow rear-door swing plus a service body inside a contained aisle. This is why the pitch is 15'-0\" and not the classic 14'-0\".",
